    "detailed_description": "Ooga like meat. Pterosaur also like meat. Pterosaur steal Ooga's meat! <strong>Ooga MAD!!!</strong> Must get meat back! Spear help Ooga get meat! Spear defy all known laws of physics! Use to advantage! Soar like Pterosaur with spear!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699570/extras/cc0064a2b9f87b422aad3c98e1f470b9.avif?t=1755230636\" width=600 height=194 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb and fly through levels using Spears<br></li><li>Master the intuitive and tight momentum system<br></li><li>A massive world with unique area mechanics and enemies<br></li><li>Dozens of unlockable OogaBoy levels with unique visuals, locked behind tough movement challenges for the highest skilled Oogas.<br></li><li>Compete against your friends' scores on the Leaderboards (Not in Demo)<br></li><li>A cute and loveable protagonist filled with combustible gasses</li></ul><br>Play the first world and a half in the free demo, secrets included!",
    "about_the_game": "Ooga like meat. Pterosaur also like meat. Pterosaur steal Ooga's meat! <strong>Ooga MAD!!!</strong> Must get meat back! Spear help Ooga get meat! Spear defy all known laws of physics! Use to advantage! Soar like Pterosaur with spear!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699570/extras/cc0064a2b9f87b422aad3c98e1f470b9.avif?t=1755230636\" width=600 height=194 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb and fly through levels using Spears<br></li><li>Master the intuitive and tight momentum system<br></li><li>A massive world with unique area mechanics and enemies<br></li><li>Dozens of unlockable OogaBoy levels with unique visuals, locked behind tough movement challenges for the highest skilled Oogas.<br></li><li>Compete against your friends' scores on the Leaderboards (Not in Demo)<br></li><li>A cute and loveable protagonist filled with combustible gasses</li></ul><br>Play the first world and a half in the free demo, secrets included!",
